+# P1525 C1177 local revalidation
+
+Status: LOCAL READY / WAIT PUBLICATION. This is finite P-owned capability
+evidence, not adopted main, a general soundness proof, independent review or
+Product GO. The Issue's explicit PUBLICATION RELEASE is still required.
+
+Authority is adopted main `4c388693b95f371783e666f5c77e0aec5d17d215`,
+CURRENT_SPEC -> Draft17.38. Exact local parent is reviewed integrated PR1508
+`ac6be8e3473f08c44fe8e9407dc33c0fb53086d6`, tree
+`7591cf7c908c9f7258d0d9512fc79d084d73fbaa`, ordered parents
+`7591848bd7f4bf8967dffd4be8d360e1901a3f06` and adopted main4c.
+Integration commit `7063ca3a770f3cea1b142f59774d63a263cc5184`, tree
+`a88510011994e1e6b719f8f7acdfcca2a60dfe66`, applied the original24 changed
+files byte-for-byte without removing adopted documentation. Its new metadata
+is not the original P1517 commit identity.
+
+The retained original candidate is implementation
+`24206697820ff5521aba0239487c5b9b0f168445` and child
+`c57fed0bad9b0e6c0dea7b1f02f1b5ff3c0cfd5c`. Original FIRST/RED, aggregate80/80,
+native19/36, unavailable Clang/formatter/sanitizers and ENV-PARTIAL remain
+unchanged in that worktree, Issue1517 and the P1520 Evidence archive at
+`e46bda3c634dc55d19f5561fb431f56720c87495`. `oracle.json` is the immutable
+historical FIRST packet (including its original prospective passive.h name);
+the active observer is passive-v2.h. Only mechanical pinned formatting and
+this documentation differ from the saved implementation. The first new
+formatter RED is preserved separately; it was not a compiler or safety PASS.
+
+## Exact supported increment
+
+The existing direct two-H mixed H/T lane admits one genuine four-step
+terminal receiver of the second original H after its scoped payload read.
+The callee ends that original lifetime, recovers its full original Storage,
+finalizes its original Domain and deallocates its original Allocation once.
+The caller then ends the first original H, and the named Copy updates the
+same original T field. H0/H1 have no phantom receiver or second T write;
+payload0 in H2 is genuine success. Actual/formal/body/result, original
+root/incarnation/R/Domain, whole-root source ownership, closed loan scopes,
+current/old Copy and affine consumption remain mandatory.
+
+No checker, public issuer, source law, API/ABI, LLVM lowering, producer or
+LiveTail capability is added. Optional five-step receiver-internal reads,
+receiver field-index1, arbitrary forwarding/owner/CFG compositions and
+general safe APIs remain outside this implementation. Existing inline direct
+and linked producer paths retain their original independent guards.
+
+## Toolchain and actual results
+
+Fresh P-only tooling checkout: T1522
+`52f49551df631e9d33c56d72011312309ef0cc28`, tree
+`b77a609e631e3d2258c0c8a366c69caf273d125b`. Its unmodified bootstrap and lock
+selected the curated SDK126520077B, SHA256
+`5369d292ef513d32758634f98ec7cf62c52f82a0a333eb330ecf9a325648b133`.
+One HTTPS acquisition passed every size/SHA/path/link/extraction/provenance/
+license/tool/relocation/marker/version guard. Generated activation was used.
+Clang and clang-format are23.1.3, upstream
+`0d261d1ca552c95a8f007e061c787ac7132fbcbc`; GCC14.2.0, CMake3.31.10,
+Python3.12.14 on actual Debian13. Distribution prerequisites were already
+installed. The curated archive is not independently GPG-signed. No T delta
+is part of this Production candidate.
+
+All compiler builds used fresh Debug frontend-only directories: NO LLVM /
+PARTIAL infrastructure; no local LLVM C API or full ordinary-suite claim.
+Compiler and emitted C used strict C17 warning/error flags. Native observers
+and real allocation faults used the same existing source/expectations.
+
+| Reached selection | Actual result |
+| --- | --- |
+| Ordinary --check, zero/42, GCC/Clang host builds |4/4 success |
+| Genuine whole-root MACHINE/owner/Copy, zero/42 |passed under all four configurations |
+| P1517 CTest cohort |GCC18/18, Clang18/18, Clang ASan18/18, Clang UBSan11/11 |
+| Strict GCC/Clang O0/O2 x zero/42 x H0/H1/H2 |24/24 native |
+| Pinned Clang ASan/UBSan, same O0/O2 matrix |24/24 native, no sanitizer diagnostics |
+| Declared source negatives |seven refuse through public definition checking and ordinary CLI; H1 leak is precision, other six semantic |
+| Artifact/foreign-origin tamper |all35 reject MACHINE/emission; output NULL, length98765 retained; pristine retry succeeds |
+| Selected host OOM |six logical sites;48 fault/retry cases across GCC, Clang and ASan; rollback/no-clobber/no-temp and clean retry pass |
+| Existing inline direct regression |P1507 A/B GCC O2 x H0/H1/H2:6 native; old owned/tamper CTest3/3 |
+| Existing linked producer regression |P1481 Z-success-zero Clang ASan O2 x H0/H1/H2:3 native |
+| Pinned formatting |all tracked C/H check passes after mechanical repair |
+
+UBSan's11 tests deliberately exclude six host OOM tests and named fault test:
+48/48 fault/retry cases were already exercised in the other three configurations.
+No fourth host campaign is claimed. ASan uses leak detection and immediate
+failure; UBSan uses immediate failure and no recovery. Physical observers
+check actual original allocation addresses, distinct Domains, closed read
+scope before EndRoot, callee second-free then caller first-free, exact same
+T/old/current/sibling and zero; they issue no program authority.
+
+Emitted bytes agree across all host/sanitizer compiler builds:
+zero11332B SHA256
+`15230624b43c22c7c78d2db2e2cb936bb56b99d8cbb12f334fdbd5cff9ae2248`,
+nonzero11333B SHA256
+`2825979356d8d38471dad7a5e93c8df824f82f8965751fd58bd103298bfeac8b`.
+
+New separate budget consumed:255/320 local,57/64 selected native,
+6/16 logical host sites,48/48 fault/retry cases,1/2 SDK acquisitions.
+The local ledger includes nested CLI/CC/guest work; two selected native
+translation units count twice. Four standard compiler build invocations are
+charged once each, with their individual compiler commands also recorded.
+No remote Compiler branch, PR, CI, READY or merge has been performed.
+Remote publication and natural Required CI remain NOT_RUN / gated. Independent
+F/R original inputs were not read; their eventual review is not supplied by
+these P tests. Preserve all raw logs, initial format failure and old evidence.
+
+## Value boundary
+
+VALUE-ALIGNMENT-RISK: this reuses a small existing private consumer and adds
+no fixture-specific trusted mechanism. It enables an actual cleanup call
+boundary, but a natural ordinary-safe library, all safe-reachable API states
+and smaller library-author plus ordinary-safe-caller UB audit/re-audit closure
+versus well-factored C remain UNMEASURED. Sound Rust ownership/Drop/safe facade
+is a fair alternative. Product GO624 PAUSED / H1 HOLD remain unchanged.
